{"id":"42bc339db2","t":"Becoming the Cheon Clan’s Mad Dog","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/2895148841535480844-193x278.jpeg","n":24,"l":24,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog"},"u":1795038521583,"desc":"كان هناك محاربٌ مجهولٌ كرّس حياته ومهنته لتشون مو ريانغ، سيد عشيرة تشون. قُتل على يد سيده. عندما بُعث من جديد، وجد نفسه متجسدًا في جسد قاتله: تشون مو ريانغ، “الكلب المسعور” الذي ذاع صيته في الشرّ. مُسلّحًا بذكريات معارك الماضي، وبصيرة نافذة، وعزيمة لا تلين، أخفى نفسه وراء قناع شاب متهور، وانغمس في صراعات السلطة الداخلية للعشيرة. من قلب العشيرة، بدأ رحلته لإنقاذ مجتمع تشون من الخراب… لإعادة كتابة المستقبل وتغيير المصير.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","خيال","فنون قتاليه"],"src":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/1/"},"2":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/2/"},"3":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/3/"},"4":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/4/"},"5":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/5/"},"6":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/6/"},"7":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/7/"},"8":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/8/"},"9":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/9/"},"10":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/10/"},"11":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/11/"},"12":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/12/"},"13":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/manga/becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog/13/"},"14":{"ml":"becoming-the-cheon-clans-mad-dog|/